{"summary": "The stage cluster shows no critical or high vulnerabilities and no secrets in the digest. Main issues are missing network policies, missing resource limits, ':latest' image tags and a Seccomp PSS failure in the shop namespace. The only admin binding is cluster-admin to Group system:masters, which looks like a platform default.", "targets": ["stage"], "frameworks": [{"name": "NSA", "passed": 14, "failed": 7, "skipped": 5, "score": 70}, {"name": "MITRE", "passed": 12, "failed": 5, "skipped": 5, "score": 75}], "findings": [{"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "No ingress/egress restrictions (network policies) on workloads", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart, shop/Deployment/web (14 resources total)", "controls": ["C-0030"], "evidence": "Kubescape C-0030 'Ingress and Egress blocked' failed on 14 resources, with examples shop/Deployment/cart and shop/Deployment/web.", "fix": "Add a default-deny NetworkPolicy in the namespace, then allow needed traffic: kubectl apply -f - <<EOF
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata: {name: default-deny, namespace: shop}
spec: {podSelector: {}, policyTypes: [Ingress, Egress]}
EOF"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Containers missing memory limits/requests", "resource": "shop/Deployment/web (9 resources total)", "controls": ["C-0004"], "evidence": "Kubescape C-0004 failed on 9 resources, with example shop/Deployment/web.", "fix": "resources:
  requests: {memory: 128Mi}
  limits: {memory: 256Mi}"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Image tag ':latest' used", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart, shop/Deployment/web, shop/Deployment/worker", "controls": ["KSV-0013"], "evidence": "Trivy k8s flagged KSV-0013 on 3 deployments in shop.", "fix": "Pin images to a specific version or digest, e.g. image: registry/app:1.2.3@sha256:<digest>"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Seccomp profile not set", "resource": "3 workloads (PSS control 10)", "controls": ["Trivy PSS 10"], "evidence": "Trivy PSS control 10 Seccomp failed on 3 resources; 16 of 17 PSS controls passed.", "fix": "securityContext:
  seccompProfile: {type: RuntimeDefault}"}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "Resource policies and CPU limits missing", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart (14 resources total)", "controls": ["C-0009", "KSV-0011"], "evidence": "Kubescape C-0009 failed on 14 resources and Trivy KSV-0011 (CPU not limited) was flagged on shop/Deployment/cart.", "fix": "Add resources.limits.cpu, or a LimitRange/ResourceQuota in the shop namespace."}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "cluster-admin bound to system:masters (likely platform default)", "resource": "ClusterRoleBinding cluster-admin", "controls": ["rbac"], "evidence": "The only admin binding is cluster-admin to Group system:masters, which matches the standard Kubernetes default; no wildcard custom roles appear in the digest.", "fix": "No change if default; restrict membership of system:masters and use named admin groups for humans."}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "Other Trivy misconfigurations and medium CVEs", "resource": "stage cluster", "controls": [], "evidence": "Trivy k8s counts show 6 MEDIUM vulnerabilities, 5 MEDIUM and 14 LOW misconfigurations, and no critical/high vulnerabilities.", "fix": "Review trivy k8s report and upgrade images with available fixed versions."}], "not_checked": [{"item": "node and control-plane CIS checks", "reason": "need a privileged node-collector pod; the audit identity is read-only"}, {"item": "git history", "reason": "secrets removed from history are not scanned"}, {"item": "Argo CD findings", "reason": "the digest contains no Argo data beyond admin bindings"}, {"item": "Repos", "reason": "no repos were included in the digest"}]}
